		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>200-foot-long orange winged serpent with three snake heads. Hates Mogaru, hunts other kaiju. One of the only intentionally evil kaiju.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 105, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend (near) +10 (4d8 + toss) or triple fire beam, <strong>MV</strong> far (burrow, fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 22</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Cold Vulnerable</strong>. Double damage from cold.</p><p></p><p><strong>Immortal</strong>. Only damaged by magic sources. Immune to fire. If slain, resurrects in 1d10 days and flees.</p><p></p><p><strong>Toss</strong>. DEX 15+ or thrown 1d100 feet in a random direction.</p><p></p><p><strong>Triple Flame Beam</strong>. Three straight lines (5' wide) extending far from Varklop. DEX 15+ or 4d8 damage, flammable items combust.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
